This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

It is a mutation battery behind a shipped fixture: the battery behind `adversarial-shard-merge`.
It edits copies of the distribution's own `merge-adversarial-shards.sh` (beside its siblings
`validate-adversarial-convergence.sh`, `partition-document.sh`, `partition-subject.sh`), which a
consumer is denied editing, and its runtime is why the arms and the mutants are separate
directories. It sources `adversarial-shard-merge/lib.sh`, so it scores the predicates the shipped arms run.
